   "widgets_values": [
    "# 09 · Head swap (BFS on Qwen 2.1) — last resort\n**Use:** body picture (keeps pose, clothes, light, place) + head picture (face + hair to carry over) → Run → `S5/headswap_*.png`.\n**Only for our own generated personas — never real people.** Prefer restaging with Identity Edit / a persona LoRA first.\nSeries 5: BFS on Qwen 2.1 kept the body picture's expression and light best; Krea 2 BFS half-blends the two faces;\nQwen-Edit 2511 BFS gives duller hair; Identity Edit copies the reference's neutral face. **Measured (local 5070 Ti, 2026-10-26):** 13 s incl. model load.\nOfficial prompt kept verbatim (`head_swap:` trigger). LoRA `bfs_head_v1.1_qwen_2.1`, Turbo schedule, cfg 1."
